message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "textract-field-memory: spatial field location memory for document processing pipelines"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency Python library that learns where fields appear on recurring
  document types and uses that spatial memory to validate OCR extractions,
  identify document types by layout, detect anomalies and template drift, and
  skip LLM calls when spatial confidence is high.
